"write","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">In the xy-plane, line r passes through the points (2,16) and (7, 17). Line s passes through the point (1, 2) and is perpendicular to line r. An equation of line s is ax+7y=c, where a and c are constants. What is the value of c?</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[],"correct":"49","solution":""},{"type":"choice","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">If x-2=3, what is the value of 3(x-2)?</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[{"name":"A","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">3</span></span><br>"},{"name":"B","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">7</span></span><br>"},{"name":"C","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">9</span></span><br>"},{"name":"D","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">18</span></span><br>"}],"correct":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">9</span></span><br>","solution":""},{"type":"write","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">For 100 neurons, the table summarizes the distribution of classification and cell body diameter.</span></span><br><span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\"><img alt=\\"\\" src=\\"/images/d2d7175afaf64cc147bff38f8f8f7860.png\\" style=\\"width: 630px; height: 260px;\\"></span></span><br><span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">One of these neurons will be selected at random. What is the probability of selecting a neuron with a cell body diameter that is less than or equal to 30 micrometers, given that it is not classified as a motor neuron? (Express your answer as a decimal or fraction, not as a percent.)</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[],"correct":"61/64,0.953,.9531","solution":""},{"type":"choice","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">The value of a toy increased by 193% from the end of 2016 to the end of 2017 and then decreased by 31% from the end of 2017 to the end of 2018. What was the net percentage increase in the value of the toy from the end of 2016 to the end of 2018?</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[{"name":"A","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">102.17%</span></span><br>"},{"name":"B","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">133.17%</span></span><br>"},{"name":"C","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">162.00%</span></span><br>"},{"name":"D","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">283.83%</span></span><br>"}],"correct":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">102.17%</span></span><br>","solution":""},{"type":"choice","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">5x+3y=6<br>The given equation is one equation in a system of two linear equations. If the system of equations has at least one solution, which of the following equations could&nbsp;be the other equation in the system?<br>I.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;7.5x+4.5y=9<br>II.&nbsp; &nbsp; 7.5x-4.5y=9</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[{"name":"A","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">I only</span></span><br>"},{"name":"B","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">II only</span></span><br>"},{"name":"C","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">I and II</span></span><br>"},{"name":"D","content":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">Neither I nor II</span></span><br>"}],"correct":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">I and II</span></span><br>","solution":""},{"type":"write","article":"<br><span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\"><img alt=\\"\\" src=\\"/images/fe0e1b88dd4f122785075654e21afcec.png\\" style=\\"width: 420px; height: 444px;\\"></span></span><br><span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">In the figure shown, points A, B, C, and E lie on the circle, and AB&lt;BC. Segment AC is perpendicular to segment BE at point D, and BD=DE=</span></span><span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"\\\\sqrt{398}\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq-root-block\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"1\\"><span class=\\"mq-non-leaf\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"6\\"><span class=\\"mq-scaled mq-sqrt-prefix\\" style=\\"transform: scale(1, 0.958333);\\">√</span><span class=\\"mq-non-leaf mq-sqrt-stem\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"7\\"><span mathquill-command-id=\\"9\\">3</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"10\\">9</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"11\\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">. The diameter of the circle is 201. If </span></span><span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"\\\\fra